        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation section-icon" style="color: #856404;"></i> Common Misconceptions</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Generic Responses:</strong> Students often provide general superficial knowledge rather than specific research-backed details.</li>
            <li><strong>Ethics Focus only:</strong> Weaker responses focus solely on ethics while ignoring the technical computational complexity.</li>
            <li><strong>Terminology:</strong> Misunderstanding terms specific to the annually changing case study (found on the final page of the IB release).</li>
