        <div class="learning-points">
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Evidence as Knowledge:</strong> In an emergency (like a factory fire), what counts as "good enough" knowledge for a robot to act?</li>
                <li><strong>Expertise:</strong> How do we evaluate the credibility of research papers vs. corporate white papers when investigating emerging tech?</li>
